# VHS tape for the four design systems demo

Output examples/vhs/02_designs.gif

Set FontSize 20
Set Width 1200
Set Height 820
Set Padding 0
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"

Hide
Type "clear && cargo run --release --example checkbox_designs"
Enter
Sleep 5s
Show
Sleep 2s

Down
Sleep 0.6s
Space
Sleep 1s
Type "s"
Sleep 2s
Type "r"
Sleep 2s
Type "h"
Sleep 1.5s
Down
Sleep 0.8s
Space
Sleep 1.5s

Hide
Type "q"
Sleep 0.3s
